# {{.Name}}

Minimal ESAPI {{.Version}} binary plug-in, generated by esapi-cli.

- Target: .NET Framework {{.TargetFramework}}, {{.Platform}}.
- Entry point: `VMS.TPS.Script.Execute(ScriptContext context)`.
- Output: `bin\Release\{{.Name}}.esapi.dll`.
- Patient-data writes are disabled in the generated script.
